      "heading": "HACCP, SFBB and the system",
      "html": "<p>The law names no one format. It asks for a system built on the seven HACCP principles. Find hazards. Find critical control points. Set limits. Monitor. Correct. Verify. Keep records.</p><p>Small caterers can use Safer Food Better Business. Larger firms build a fuller HACCP plan.</p><p>Quickler records the daily diary and monitoring, with photos and times. It does not write your HACCP plan. See the <a href=\"/pages/haccp-checklist-app-uk.html\">HACCP checklist guide</a>.</p>"
