      "heading": "Temperature, cleaning and allergens",
      "html": "<p><strong>Temperature.</strong> Cold food at 8C or below. Hot food at 63C or above. These are legal limits in England, with exceptions. Cook to a core of 70C for 2 minutes, or an equivalent such as 75C for 30 seconds. See the <a href=\"/pages/kitchen-temperature-log-app-uk.html\">kitchen temperature log guide</a>.</p><p><strong>Allergens.</strong> The 14 main allergens must be managed. Food prepacked for direct sale must carry the name and a full ingredients list, with allergens emphasised, from 1 October 2021.</p><p><strong>Cleaning.</strong> A cleaning schedule, plus opening and closing checks. Each is recorded with the person, the time and a photo.</p>"
